  "id": "2026-09-24-drop-state-from-handwritten-markers",
  "title": {
    "zh": "手写模块标记行不再复制易变的 state",
    "en": "Stop copying mutable state into handwritten module markers"
  },
  "status": "verified",
  "intent": {
    "zh": "src/ 的模块 docstring 标记行把设计树的 state 复制了进来，而 state 会变、副本无人维护，已造成 74 处假话（5 个手写容器 + 69 个叶子，都写着 state=planned 而设计树里是 active）。根因是「把易变的值复制进人写的文件」。本次让手写文件的标记行只保留「（容器模块）/（叶子模块）」，state 交给设计树与 MODULE_MAP；生成器自己的模板产物（46 个容器 __init__.py）继续由生成器维护 state，保持不变。并加测试锁死：非模板产物里不得再出现带 state 的标记。",
    "en": "Module docstring markers in src/ copied the design-tree state, but state changes and the copy is unmaintained, producing 74 falsehoods (5 handwritten containers + 69 leaves saying state=planned while the tree says active). Root cause: copying a mutable value into a hand-written file. Handwritten markers now keep only the container/leaf label; state lives in the design tree and MODULE_MAP. Generator-owned templates (46 container __init__.py) keep their state. A test locks this in: non-template files must not carry a state-bearing marker."
  },
